Flash-X
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The Deforming Bubble mini-app in this repository (src/, params/) is modeled on
Flash-X, https://flash-x.org, developed by the Flash-X team. Its numerical
kernels and problem setup were ported to C++ from the following Flash-X
sources, with modifications:

  source/numericalTools/Stencils/StencilsAdvection/Stencils_advectWeno.F90
  source/numericalTools/Stencils/StencilsLevelset/Stencils_lsRedistance2d.F90
  source/physics/Multiphase/MultiphaseMain/Multiphase_redistance.F90
  source/Simulation/SimulationMain/incompFlow/DeformingBubble/
      Simulation_initBlock.F90
      Driver_evolveAll.F90-mc

